WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.262 --> 00:00:02.178
- This is Ariana's
first season as a coach.

00:00:02.178 --> 00:00:06.230
So what has been the best
thing about coaching so far?

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:08.520
- Other than just getting to know you all

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.060
and spend that time and laugh so hard.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.040
I just love seeing the
talent that's on the show

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:16.720
and getting to know these
artists and work with them.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.390
It's just like a really special experience

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:19.620
to be able to share

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.970
some of what we've learned-

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:21.803
- [Kelly] Yeah!

00:00:21.803 --> 00:00:22.636
- and been able to do in our lives

00:00:22.636 --> 00:00:23.469
with these artists

00:00:23.469 --> 00:00:25.010
that are just wanting
to do the same thing.

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:26.650
It's a really special opportunity

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.830
to be able to share that with people.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.300
To be in that position
is really interesting.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.856
It's just so cool to be there and

00:00:31.856 --> 00:00:32.689
- Yeah

00:00:32.689 --> 00:00:33.720
- They're all so nice and cool.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.740
I love them. I'm obsessed with my team.

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:36.573
I talk to them all the time.

00:00:36.573 --> 00:00:38.373
- Oh my God, your first
team, too. It's like...

00:00:38.373 --> 00:00:39.320
You get so upset.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.620
You love them all, but it's so exciting.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:43.030
- I've broken every rule in my contract.

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:43.863
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:43.863 --> 00:00:45.529
(audience laughing) I talk
to them all, all the time.

00:00:45.529 --> 00:00:46.362
I'm like DMing them.

00:00:46.362 --> 00:00:47.660
They're like, "You're
not supposed to do that."

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:49.260
And I'm like (whispers) "sorry."

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:51.383
Fine.

00:00:51.383 --> 00:00:52.670
- No, I know you're sending
stuff to the hotel for them

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:53.503
you're very-

00:00:53.503 --> 00:00:54.433
- [Ariana] I know.

00:00:54.433 --> 00:00:55.266
This is the coolest
thing about you though.

00:00:55.266 --> 00:00:57.280
I really hope people get to see from you.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:59.320
Like just working with you on the show,

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:02.980
backstage I have to have
my eye makeup re-done,

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:04.810
she's hysterical.

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:06.970
She's so funny. Very quick witted.

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:07.930
I didn't know this about you.

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:08.763
I knew you were talented.

00:01:08.763 --> 00:01:09.820
I knew you'd be a great coach.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:10.840
I knew all those things,

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.530
but I didn't know how funny you were

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:14.290
because we'd never really hung much, so.

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:15.355
- This is lifeless. I know.

00:01:15.355 --> 00:01:16.188
(audience laughing)

00:01:16.188 --> 00:01:17.179
- [Kelly] This is lifeless.

00:01:17.179 --> 00:01:18.012
- I seem totally, yeah.

00:01:18.012 --> 00:01:19.095
- Well, we only see,
- No, I get it.

00:01:19.095 --> 00:01:19.928
when we're watching you
we only see performing.

00:01:19.928 --> 00:01:20.761
- For sure.

00:01:20.761 --> 00:01:21.860
And seven rings, which is like, what?

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:22.920
Who is that? You know?

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:24.356
- Well that's a great song, so.

00:01:24.356 --> 00:01:26.022
- Thank you. But like what does that even-

00:01:26.022 --> 00:01:26.990
- That's like one of my favorites.

00:01:26.990 --> 00:01:28.656
- You know what I mean.
That's not a person, that's...

00:01:28.656 --> 00:01:29.489
(kelly laughs)

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:30.322
- She's a robot.

00:01:30.322 --> 00:01:31.988
- Punchline. You know what
I mean? It's a punchline.

00:01:31.988 --> 00:01:32.821
- No, no, but you're hilarious.

00:01:32.821 --> 00:01:33.654
- Thank you.

00:01:33.654 --> 00:01:34.487
- And I thought it was so interesting

00:01:34.487 --> 00:01:36.130
because usually it takes
coaches that come on,

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:37.420
just being there for eight seasons

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:39.570
it takes them a minute to get used

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:40.820
to being free,

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:43.080
with their words and their personality.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.500
And you kind of like, right-

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.890
It was, I think the second
or third day of the blinds.

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:48.915
You were like, "Nevermind, I'm here."

00:01:48.915 --> 00:01:49.748
(Ariana laughs)

00:01:49.748 --> 00:01:50.581
And it was awesome.

00:01:50.581 --> 00:01:52.100
Did you find it nerve-racking?

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.170
- It was a little nerve-racking,

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:55.650
but you all made me feel so comfortable

00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:57.550
and are the nicest people

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.590
that I've met in this whole thing,

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:00.690
just the most fun ever.

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:01.880
And you made me feel so comfortable.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:03.260
So it's because of you guys.

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:04.093
You guys were push-

00:02:04.093 --> 00:02:05.210
and also Blake was
pushing all the buttons.

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:06.043
Sorry. I'll shut up.

00:02:06.043 --> 00:02:07.836
- Yes. But you know what though?

00:02:07.836 --> 00:02:08.669
- He gotta.

00:02:08.669 --> 00:02:11.250
- He does though because he feels able to,

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:12.287
that's when I feel like
it's the best chemistry.

00:02:12.287 --> 00:02:13.120
- And it's helpful.

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:14.543
- Yeah it's helpful. It
sets you up for jokes.

00:02:14.543 --> 00:02:15.520
- It's helpful.

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:16.353
It does.

00:02:16.353 --> 00:02:17.186
(Kelly laughs)

00:02:17.186 --> 00:02:18.800
He gives you a good setup every time.

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:20.200
- [Kelly] Yeah. He just opens his mouth.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.714
- Yes. That's it.

00:02:21.714 --> 00:02:23.050
He just walks in.
- Well, they act tough.

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:24.974
- He just walks and there's a joke coming.

00:02:24.974 --> 00:02:25.807
(Ariana laughs)

00:02:25.807 --> 00:02:27.140
But Blake and John,

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:28.990
they are terrified of you, look at this.

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:29.823
- [Ariana] Oh.

00:02:29.823 --> 00:02:30.780
- Yes.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:35.780
- Ariana has a huge fan
base and they are fervent.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:38.300
And if they show up to vote,

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.360
we're all in trouble.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:40.266
- One hundred percent!

00:02:40.266 --> 00:02:41.570
(John laughing)

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:42.713
Are you scared at all?

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:44.436
- Now what?

00:02:44.436 --> 00:02:45.269
- [Kelly] Would you even tell us?

00:02:45.269 --> 00:02:46.935
I'm not afraid of her fan
base. Where are they at?

00:02:46.935 --> 00:02:48.250
Look at me. Where's the camera?

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:49.083
- [John] Bring 'em on.

00:02:49.083 --> 00:02:50.630
- Ariana fans, bring it on.

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:53.170
I'm not afraid of Ariana.

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:55.766
- He is so afraid of Ariana's fan base.

00:02:55.766 --> 00:02:58.600
(audience laughs)

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:00.470
Thoughts? We said this when you came in,

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:01.303
I mean it was apparent,

00:03:01.303 --> 00:03:02.680
literally the entire
audience was screaming.

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:05.420
We were like, "We have no chance."

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:06.380
It was amazing.

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:07.614
- I don't know that that's true.

00:03:07.614 --> 00:03:09.510
I really do not think that's true.

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:10.343
I mean-

00:03:10.343 --> 00:03:13.520
- But you're a huge star, I don't know-

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:14.353
News flash.

00:03:14.353 --> 00:03:15.864
- What are you talking
about Kelly Clarkson?

00:03:15.864 --> 00:03:16.697
- What?

00:03:16.697 --> 00:03:17.530
(audience laughing)

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.743
- No, I'm just saying
it's one those things,

00:03:18.743 --> 00:03:20.363
that you watch out.

00:03:20.363 --> 00:03:21.300
(audience cheering)

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.917
(Kelly laughing)

00:03:22.917 --> 00:03:23.750
- No!

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:24.583
- Sorry.

00:03:24.583 --> 00:03:25.416
- It's so different.

00:03:25.416 --> 00:03:26.249
- [Ariana] Sorry.

00:03:26.249 --> 00:03:28.410
- Anyway. It's gotta feel a little good.

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.570
Like a little bit of
competitiveness in you

00:03:30.570 --> 00:03:32.420
has gotta be like, "They're
all a little terrified."

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:33.310
- I really don't think

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:35.580
that I have the chance you think I have.

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:36.740
- You can think all you want,

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:37.573
but it's true.

00:03:37.573 --> 00:03:38.406
(audience laughing)

00:03:38.406 --> 00:03:39.830
- First of all. Thank you.

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:40.830
The beautiful thing about it

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:43.040
is that even just being on the show,

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:44.260
this is such a beautiful chance

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:46.340
for them to be seen by
the world in a new way.

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:47.820
This is just us getting to meet them

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:51.060
and give them this first chance

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:52.090
and it's really special.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:53.900
Cause I think you're gonna
fall in love with all of them.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:54.733
I really do.

00:03:54.733 --> 00:03:56.540
- They're so good. They're so good.

